     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div> I am trying to run a SEM through Lavaan where I have 700 variables and 230 observation. I am getting the error: <br><div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;color:black\"><font size=\"2\">non-positive definite covariance matrix</font></span><br></div><div><p style=\"line-height:normal;text-indent:0in;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;vertical-align:baseline;word-break:normal\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\">lavaan</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\"> WARNING: small number of observations (nobs &lt; </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\">nvar</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\">) nobs = 230 </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\">nvar</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;color:rgb(197,6,11);vertical-align:baseline\"> = 769 </span></font></p></div>I am curious about possible solutions to this issue. Does anyone know what Lavaan can handle if nobs &lt; nvar</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
