     "<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>That is not an error, it is a warning.</div>"
